## 🔌 API ENTEGRASYONLARı İÇİN

### Shopify
```php
app/Services/ShopifyService.php

Methodlar:
- getOrders($limit, $status)
- getOrderDetails($orderId)
- createProduct($data)
- updateProduct($productId, $data)
- updateInventory($variantId, $quantity)
- fulfillOrder($orderId, $lineItems)

Error Handling:
- Shopify rate limiting (429)
- Network errors retry
- Invalid token handling
```

### UyumSoft
```php
app/Services/UyumSoftService.php

Methodlar:
- getProducts($limit, $offset)
- getProductDetails($productId)
- getStocks()
- getInvoices($dateFrom, $dateTo)
- syncProduct($productData)

Error Handling:
- Auth failures
- API timeout
- Invalid credentials
```

### Kargo Firmaları
```php
app/Services/CargoService.php

Methodlar:
- createShipment($orderData, $cargoCompany)
- getTrackingInfo($trackingNumber)
- generateLabel($shipmentId)
- generateInvoice($shipmentId)
- getAvailableCompanies()

Her firma için ayrı class:
- Aras Kargo
- MNG Kargo
- Yurtiçi Kargo
- PTT
```

### Mail & SMS
```php
app/Services/MailService.php
app/Services/SmsService.php

Methodlar:
- sendOrderConfirmation($order)
- sendShipmentNotification($shipment)
- sendCustomMessage($recipient, $template, $data)
```

