## 🔄 SİNKRONİZASYON KURALLAR

### Job Classes
```php
app/Jobs/SyncShopifyOrders.php
- Handles queue gözlemlensin
- Timeout set edilsin
- Retry logic
- Failed job handling
- Job progress log
```

### Schedule (Kernel.php)
```php
// Her 1-5 dakikada bir kontrol
$schedule->job(new SyncShopifyOrders)
    ->everyMinute()
    ->withoutOverlapping();

// Her 30 dakikada bir
$schedule->job(new SyncUyumSoftProducts)
    ->everyThirtyMinutes()
    ->withoutOverlapping();

// Her 10 dakikada bir
$schedule->job(new SyncStock)
    ->everyTenMinutes()
    ->withoutOverlapping();
```

---

## 📊 VERITABANI KURALLAR

### Migration Kuralları
```php
Schema::create('table_name', function (Blueprint $table) {
    $table->id();
    // Komut yazarken 'db:' prefix var mı kontrol et
    $table->string('column')->nullable();
    $table->index('column'); // Sık sorgulanan alanlar
    $table->foreignId('related_id')->constrained();
    $table->softDeletes(); // Gerekli ise
    $table->timestamps();
});
```

### Model Kuralları
```php
class Model extends Model {
    use SoftDeletes; // Gerekirse
    
    protected $fillable = []; // Explicit
    protected $hidden = []; // Sensitif veri
    protected $casts = []; // Type casting
    
    // Relationships
    public function relatedModel() {
        return $this->hasMany(RelatedModel::class);
    }
}
```

