## 📝 LOGGING & DEBUGGING

### Log Struktur
```php
Log::channel('sync')->info('Sync completed', [
    'type' => 'product_sync',
    'count' => 100,
    'duration' => 5.2,
    'errors' => 0,
]);

Log::channel('error')->error('Sync failed', [
    'exception' => $exception->getMessage(),
    'trace' => $exception->getTraceAsString(),
]);
```

### Hata Yönetimi
```php
try {
    // API call
} catch (ApiException $e) {
    // Log & notify
    Log::error('API Error: ' . $e->getMessage());
    // Retry logic
} catch (Exception $e) {
    // Genel error
    report($e);
}
```

